WEBVTT

01:34.860 --> 01:37.650
[Bloom Life]

01:38.850 --> 01:42.690
[2015]

01:50.750 --> 01:51.810
Go ahead. Go ahead.

02:08.060 --> 02:09.000
Uncle Elishir.

02:09.710 --> 02:11.970
Why are you playing Tobok again?

02:11.970 --> 02:14.130
Mom, can't you do something?

02:14.310 --> 02:16.060
What are you holding?

02:16.079 --> 02:16.940
Knucklebones.

02:17.000 --> 02:17.840
They made a pact.

02:17.840 --> 02:19.500
No matter when and where,

02:19.500 --> 02:20.470
whoever fails to take out

02:20.470 --> 02:21.730
his own knucklebone

02:21.760 --> 02:23.290
has to give the other person a sheep.

02:23.290 --> 02:25.310
This game is called Tobok.

02:26.460 --> 02:29.020
Three, two, one.

02:32.810 --> 02:33.930
Both of them keep their knucklebones

02:33.930 --> 02:35.250
with them at all times,

02:35.410 --> 02:37.300
so it's always a tie.

02:48.370 --> 02:51.680
[Episode 5: The Beginning of
a Great Friendship]

02:54.470 --> 02:56.250
Happy Eid al-Adha.

02:57.960 --> 02:59.890
Come celebrate at our house later.

03:12.610 --> 03:13.350
How is it?

03:16.030 --> 03:16.890
Not bad, right?

03:22.030 --> 03:23.370
Let me tell you something.

03:23.370 --> 03:24.300
I deleted

03:24.300 --> 03:25.700
the dating application.

03:25.840 --> 03:26.680
You'd delete

03:26.970 --> 03:28.020
yours too.

03:29.120 --> 03:30.180
It's okay that you've deleted yours.

03:30.180 --> 03:31.780
But don't interfere with me.

03:32.500 --> 03:33.630
Just delete it.

03:33.900 --> 03:34.630
Why?

03:35.540 --> 03:36.530
Young man,

03:36.530 --> 03:37.910
look at the clothes you're wearing.

03:37.910 --> 03:38.870
It looks terrible.

03:38.870 --> 03:39.640
It's a festival.

03:39.640 --> 03:41.090
You need to dress for the occasion.

03:41.090 --> 03:41.780
Adalanti,

03:42.760 --> 03:44.200
bring a Kanawayi shirt.

03:47.350 --> 03:48.079
You're back.

03:56.590 --> 03:57.130
Dad.

03:58.010 --> 03:58.600
Dad.

03:59.410 --> 04:01.540
Why is Mulading sharpening the knife?

04:02.120 --> 04:04.980
We are distributing mutton
for the festival today.

04:05.130 --> 04:06.790
I asked Mulading to handle it.

04:06.890 --> 04:08.520
How could you let him do it?

04:08.540 --> 04:10.290
Isn't it you and Uncle's work?

04:12.130 --> 04:12.810
Mulading

04:12.810 --> 04:15.060
will become my son-in-law soon.

04:15.560 --> 04:17.440
Of course, he should handle it.

04:42.360 --> 04:43.890
I'm here to return your bag.

04:49.360 --> 04:51.800
I'll transfer the money to you.

04:52.020 --> 04:53.230
No need.

04:53.690 --> 04:55.420
I already ate the pomegranate.

04:55.870 --> 04:57.450
The pomegranate isn't worth much.

04:57.450 --> 04:59.260
I broke your jar,
so I should pay you back.

04:59.260 --> 05:01.330
No need, really.

05:02.890 --> 05:03.370
But

05:04.510 --> 05:05.770
could you do me a favor?

05:06.070 --> 05:06.600
A favor?

05:07.740 --> 05:08.480
What is it?

05:09.250 --> 05:10.650
Do you have a girlfriend?

05:22.810 --> 05:24.810
Can you pretend to be my boyfriend?

05:25.390 --> 05:26.560
Is that okay?

05:31.300 --> 05:33.300
If it's too much trouble,

05:33.300 --> 05:34.690
just forget it.

05:35.320 --> 05:35.860
I...

05:35.890 --> 05:37.960
I can ask someone else.

05:39.390 --> 05:40.210
It's really fine.

05:40.210 --> 05:42.260
I guess I could.

05:45.450 --> 05:46.570
So you agreed?

05:49.890 --> 05:50.390
Okay.

05:54.420 --> 05:55.620
I'm Parhat.

05:55.810 --> 05:56.659
I'm Laili.

05:57.250 --> 05:57.860
Laili.

06:11.730 --> 06:13.060
And this is Ying.

06:13.590 --> 06:14.390
Ying.

06:26.370 --> 06:27.500
How did you do that?

06:33.659 --> 06:34.550
No, I can't.

06:42.980 --> 06:43.620
Uncle.

06:44.330 --> 06:45.680
Hello, Uncle.

06:45.680 --> 06:46.870
Hello.

06:46.870 --> 06:47.870
I brought some stuff.

06:47.870 --> 06:48.930
Happy Eid al-Adha.

06:49.620 --> 06:50.070
Wait.

06:50.250 --> 06:51.060
Adalanti.

06:51.300 --> 06:52.540
Get one more shirt.

06:52.540 --> 06:53.220
Get one more shirt.

06:53.220 --> 06:54.000
Got it.

06:54.000 --> 06:54.510
Shirt?

06:55.890 --> 06:56.450
Hello.

07:03.360 --> 07:03.920
Hello.

07:04.240 --> 07:04.800
Hello.

07:27.050 --> 07:29.510
Go, Grandma wants to give
you a red envelope.

07:31.210 --> 07:32.710
Say thank you to Grandma.

07:32.730 --> 07:33.890
Happy Eid al-Adha. Thank you.

07:33.890 --> 07:35.600
Thank you, grandma.

07:35.600 --> 07:36.620
Happy Eid al-Adha!

07:36.620 --> 07:38.740
You have to dance
after receiving money.

07:38.740 --> 07:39.630
How? I don't know how to dance.

07:39.630 --> 07:40.310
Just like this. Come on.

07:40.310 --> 07:41.330
I can't dance.

07:41.659 --> 07:42.980
Follow the rhythm.

07:43.360 --> 07:44.180
Come on.

07:46.870 --> 07:47.340
Yes.

07:47.420 --> 07:48.350
Dance like this.

07:50.000 --> 07:51.060
Follow the rhythm.

07:53.659 --> 07:55.060
You are quite good at it.

07:55.300 --> 07:56.500
I learned it just now.

07:57.510 --> 07:58.440
Quite talented.

08:06.920 --> 08:09.010
The mutton is cooked so well.

08:09.810 --> 08:10.690
Auntie,

08:11.280 --> 08:12.680
let Mulading distribute

08:12.810 --> 08:14.220
the mutton this year.

08:14.920 --> 08:15.920
What do you think?

08:22.050 --> 08:23.110
Let me introduce

08:23.140 --> 08:24.820
my boyfriend, Parhatin.

08:25.450 --> 08:27.510
Hello everyone.

08:27.740 --> 08:29.540
Hello.

08:31.220 --> 08:32.220
Take a seat first.

08:34.150 --> 08:35.940
Hello, grandma.

08:36.150 --> 08:37.289
I picked him up on the road.

08:37.289 --> 08:38.549
Picked him up on the road?

08:38.549 --> 08:39.669
You picked up a boyfriend?

08:39.669 --> 08:41.789
You are quite bold, Little girl.

08:41.789 --> 08:42.530
Parhat.

08:45.820 --> 08:47.620
Adijiang's grandson?

08:47.620 --> 08:49.370
Yes, grandma.

08:49.370 --> 08:51.100
Adijiang is my grandfather.

08:51.250 --> 08:55.130
Good boy. Drink tea and eat some snacks.

08:55.630 --> 08:56.870
Asimjan.

08:57.280 --> 08:57.870
Grandma.

08:57.910 --> 09:01.840
You distribute the mutton
to everyone today.

09:03.170 --> 09:03.810
Okay.

09:05.150 --> 09:06.350
What did grandma say?

09:06.510 --> 09:08.460
Grandma mistook you for Asimjan.

09:08.480 --> 09:10.680
She asked you to distribute the mutton.

09:10.860 --> 09:11.930
Grandma, I'm

09:12.050 --> 09:12.460
Zhou.

09:13.140 --> 09:16.210
Wearing this clothes, you look
exactly like

09:16.240 --> 09:18.500
my Asimjan.

09:19.600 --> 09:21.080
Who is Asimjan?

09:21.920 --> 09:23.250
Laili's elder brother.

09:23.450 --> 09:25.110
He passed away many years ago.

09:35.480 --> 09:37.510
Come, the mutton is ready.

09:37.740 --> 09:38.630
Eat it while it's warm.

09:38.630 --> 09:39.670
Eat it while it's warm, everyone.

09:39.670 --> 09:42.190
Grandma, I will be responsible for
distributing the mutton this year.

09:42.190 --> 09:42.850
Who are you?

09:42.860 --> 09:43.390
Grandma.

09:45.290 --> 09:47.850
How can you touch our family's mutton?

09:48.550 --> 09:49.630
Grandma.

09:49.870 --> 09:51.120
Don't misunderstand.

09:51.120 --> 09:52.130
My mother is old.

09:52.130 --> 09:52.890
Her eyesight is bad.

09:52.890 --> 09:54.440
She mistook him for someone else.

09:54.440 --> 09:55.360
All right.

09:55.360 --> 09:56.290
Come on.

09:56.290 --> 09:57.600
Come on, everyone, eat up.

09:57.600 --> 09:59.150
Have some food.

09:59.550 --> 10:01.240
Happy Eid al-Adha, everyone.

10:05.870 --> 10:06.870
What's up?

10:06.870 --> 10:08.550
I finally got a chance to come back.

10:08.550 --> 10:10.290
Why are you so unhappy?

10:10.290 --> 10:10.940
Am I not welcome?

10:10.940 --> 10:12.340
No.

10:12.360 --> 10:13.110
Minawar.

10:14.390 --> 10:15.650
Why didn't Sadiq come?

10:16.070 --> 10:17.270
I asked him to go to his own home.

10:17.270 --> 10:18.390
And I came to mine.

10:18.790 --> 10:19.550
It doesn't conflict.

10:19.550 --> 10:21.010
I didn't let him follow me.

10:21.300 --> 10:22.520
Nonsense.

10:22.870 --> 10:23.750
Dad.

10:23.750 --> 10:25.150
Everyone is here for the holiday.

10:25.150 --> 10:26.270
Don't scold me.

10:26.270 --> 10:28.330
I'm hungry. Give me something to eat.

10:28.740 --> 10:29.480
Minawar.

10:30.090 --> 10:32.150
Did your mother-in-law not feed you?

10:32.340 --> 10:33.810
How did you get so thin?

10:34.340 --> 10:35.370
Really?

10:35.820 --> 10:36.980
Really?

10:36.980 --> 10:38.530
Yes. You're slim now.

10:38.530 --> 10:39.410
That's great.

10:39.670 --> 10:41.410
Then, I won't hide it from everyone.

10:41.410 --> 10:43.070
I have good news for everyone.

10:43.370 --> 10:45.510
I'm going to play Sänäm in the troupe.

10:45.510 --> 10:46.360
Sänäm!

10:47.340 --> 10:48.130
Good!

10:50.780 --> 10:51.480
Laili.

10:51.750 --> 10:52.880
Is this your friend?

10:52.890 --> 10:53.980
He's not my friend.

10:54.060 --> 10:56.060
He's my future husband and my family.

10:56.060 --> 10:57.920
A lady shouldn't say that.

10:59.620 --> 11:00.440
Shame on you!

11:00.440 --> 11:01.750
How am I shameless?

11:01.750 --> 11:03.440
You force me to marry every day.

11:03.440 --> 11:04.550
Now that I've found a boyfriend.

11:04.550 --> 11:05.550
Why are you upset?

11:15.670 --> 11:16.270
Master.

11:16.390 --> 11:17.650
Please don't be angry.

11:18.670 --> 11:19.290
It's fine,

11:20.110 --> 11:21.510
as long as Laili is happy.

11:22.170 --> 11:22.820
Bro.

11:23.500 --> 11:24.240
Sit for a while.

11:24.240 --> 11:25.670
I'll go pour you some more tea.

11:25.670 --> 11:26.370
Mulading.

11:26.980 --> 11:28.010
Sit down.

11:29.440 --> 11:30.050
Laili.

11:31.270 --> 11:33.800
Mulading has been
in our family for ten years.

11:35.360 --> 11:37.120
I raised him like a son.

11:40.720 --> 11:42.600
He is your future husband.

11:43.240 --> 11:44.940
He's not!

11:45.170 --> 11:46.550
And he is not your son.

11:46.550 --> 11:47.880
My brother is long gone.

11:54.880 --> 11:56.000
Batur.

11:56.030 --> 11:56.460
Uncle.

11:56.750 --> 11:57.250
Dad.

12:11.610 --> 12:13.280
Don't go back today.

12:13.300 --> 12:14.180
Just stay here.

12:14.640 --> 12:16.470
No, I still have to go back.

12:17.200 --> 12:19.100
Or my dad won't be able to sleep.

12:21.560 --> 12:22.930
Don't worry.

12:22.950 --> 12:25.170
I'm not really mad at my dad.

12:25.410 --> 12:27.030
I'm just mad at myself.

12:28.460 --> 12:29.780
I often think that,

12:30.390 --> 12:31.840
back then,

12:32.270 --> 12:33.410
if I hadn't

12:33.430 --> 12:35.230
asked my brother to feed the dog,

12:35.460 --> 12:38.060
he wouldn't have been crushed
under the house.

12:39.430 --> 12:40.060
Then,

12:41.220 --> 12:43.940
our family wouldn't have lost hope.

12:44.290 --> 12:46.630
Maybe things wouldn't be like this now.

12:49.010 --> 12:51.510
You think too much.

12:51.880 --> 12:53.430
It's not your fault.

12:53.460 --> 12:54.500
It's not your problem.

12:54.500 --> 12:55.770
I think it is my fault.

12:55.910 --> 12:57.340
No.

12:59.820 --> 13:00.630
Coming.

13:01.620 --> 13:03.110
Coming.

13:02.590 --> 13:06.370
[Ten years ago]

13:06.620 --> 13:09.170
My Asimjan has grown up too.

13:09.360 --> 13:10.980
Let him distribute

13:10.980 --> 13:13.630
this year's mutton to us.

13:13.720 --> 13:14.480
Laili,

13:14.740 --> 13:17.270
your favorite sheep tail fat
dipped in chili.

13:18.050 --> 13:19.650
My brother loves me the most.

13:24.620 --> 13:26.820
Laili, I gave it a name,

13:27.220 --> 13:28.170
Meat-buns.

13:28.460 --> 13:30.050
Okay, it's chubby.

13:31.770 --> 13:32.610
Let me hold it.

13:32.610 --> 13:33.150
No.

13:33.150 --> 13:33.940
Let me hold it for a while.

13:33.940 --> 13:34.390
No.

13:34.390 --> 13:35.720
Come on, let me hold it for a bit.

13:35.720 --> 13:36.480
Let me hold it.

13:36.480 --> 13:37.750
Fine, here you go.

13:37.750 --> 13:38.820
So cute.

13:40.130 --> 13:41.630
Look, brother.

13:41.630 --> 13:43.630
I made a small bowl for it.

13:44.410 --> 13:46.670
Do you think Dad will
let it into the kiln?

13:46.930 --> 13:48.420
Yes, I believe in you.

13:48.480 --> 13:49.240
Then, you tell Dad to do it.

13:49.240 --> 13:50.010
Slow down.

13:50.010 --> 13:50.820
Goodbye.

13:51.000 --> 13:51.820
Bye.

14:08.650 --> 14:09.380
I'm leaving.

14:09.410 --> 14:10.820
We'll walk you in.

14:11.080 --> 14:11.720
No need.

14:11.720 --> 14:13.470
We'll watch you go in before we leave.

14:13.470 --> 14:14.950
It's fine, I can go by myself.

14:14.950 --> 14:16.000
Let's go.

14:21.220 --> 14:21.770
Let's go.

14:22.890 --> 14:23.750
We're leaving.

14:34.550 --> 14:35.700
Are you

14:35.700 --> 14:36.440
okay?

14:37.700 --> 14:38.580
Actually,

14:39.440 --> 14:41.030
I'm really sorry

14:41.030 --> 14:41.890
for letting you

14:41.950 --> 14:43.380
see this scene.

14:43.600 --> 14:45.440
I don't even know how to face you.

14:46.200 --> 14:46.980
It's fine.

14:47.550 --> 14:49.150
I just came to see how you are.

14:49.420 --> 14:50.670
I'm happy to see you're okay.

14:50.670 --> 14:51.340
Well,

14:52.530 --> 14:53.530
I'll leave first.

14:56.860 --> 14:58.200
Thank you.

14:59.860 --> 15:00.480
No problem.

15:00.480 --> 15:02.480
If this happens again, just call me.

15:03.700 --> 15:04.330
No,

15:04.360 --> 15:05.400
that's not what I meant.

15:05.400 --> 15:06.230
I mean,

15:06.940 --> 15:08.140
if you ever need help,

15:08.250 --> 15:09.650
you can always come to me.

15:17.940 --> 15:19.370
-Bye.
-Bye.

15:20.980 --> 15:21.840
Go inside.

15:45.750 --> 15:46.550
I'm back.

15:47.350 --> 15:48.520
Why are you back so late?

15:48.520 --> 15:49.780
I'm starving to death.

15:54.650 --> 15:56.080
Sadiq, let me tell you,

15:56.270 --> 15:58.650
the troupe leader finally
praised me today.

15:58.650 --> 15:59.710
-She said I…
-Good.

16:02.580 --> 16:04.040
Can you pour me some water?

16:08.030 --> 16:08.840
Sure.

16:28.250 --> 16:28.790
Eat up.

16:35.010 --> 16:36.720
Can we eat less meat?

16:36.890 --> 16:38.350
The calories are too high.

16:38.510 --> 16:39.840
I want some vegetables.

16:41.200 --> 16:43.120
I packed naan with mutton for you.

16:43.120 --> 16:44.520
How is it not nutritious?

16:45.460 --> 16:47.860
Isn't this mutton good?
It has fat and lean.

16:48.550 --> 16:51.190
This onion can be seen as a vegetable too.

16:51.210 --> 16:51.780
Eat up.

16:52.320 --> 16:54.100
I was too tired after work yesterday.

16:54.100 --> 16:54.700
And

16:55.330 --> 16:56.580
there was a pile of unwashed dishes.

16:56.580 --> 16:58.500
You told me to leave them alone for now.

16:58.500 --> 16:59.750
I thought you would wash them.

16:59.750 --> 17:01.550
But those dishes are still

17:01.550 --> 17:02.650
in the kitchen.

17:04.140 --> 17:05.540
Let me ask you a question.

17:06.569 --> 17:08.250
Last month,

17:09.020 --> 17:10.990
I wanted to get a new interior for my car.

17:10.990 --> 17:12.450
Did I ask you to do it for me?

17:12.990 --> 17:13.599
No.

17:14.460 --> 17:15.180
Why?

17:17.310 --> 17:17.960
Because

17:18.800 --> 17:20.160
that's your business.

17:20.160 --> 17:21.810
And I don't know anything about that.

17:21.810 --> 17:22.400
Exactly.

17:23.619 --> 17:25.119
I'm the one who couldn't
stand the old interior,

17:25.119 --> 17:25.790
not you.

17:26.079 --> 17:27.960
So I had to change it myself.

17:28.260 --> 17:28.880
But think about it,

17:28.880 --> 17:30.650
I don't mind leaving dirty dishes
there for two days,

17:30.650 --> 17:32.450
or even piling them up for a week.

17:32.640 --> 17:33.830
When Auntie comes on the weekend,

17:33.830 --> 17:35.440
just let her wash them.

17:37.640 --> 17:39.900
This mutton is pretty good. Have a taste.

17:45.070 --> 17:45.920
What's up now?

17:47.160 --> 17:47.720
Nothing.

17:57.590 --> 17:58.070
What are you doing?

17:58.070 --> 17:59.190
You've been in there for ages.

17:59.190 --> 18:00.790
Wait a minute. I'm not done yet.

18:00.790 --> 18:01.770
Hurry up.

18:16.680 --> 18:18.210
What did you want to tell me?

18:19.240 --> 18:19.940
Come here.

18:21.550 --> 18:22.440
I'm pregnant.

18:24.610 --> 18:25.400
Really?

18:25.400 --> 18:26.660
Laili, come here.

18:27.160 --> 18:28.010
What's wrong?

18:28.150 --> 18:29.120
She's pregnant.

18:32.310 --> 18:33.250
Really?

18:33.400 --> 18:34.900
Would I joke about this?

18:35.550 --> 18:36.880
What are you going to do?

18:38.030 --> 18:39.140
Have the baby.

18:39.460 --> 18:41.680
I didn't know you liked kids so much.

18:42.830 --> 18:44.350
It's not that I like kids.

18:44.350 --> 18:45.010
I just think

18:45.570 --> 18:47.570
getting married is for having kids.

18:47.590 --> 18:50.190
I'd like to have them sooner
rather than later.

18:50.700 --> 18:52.950
Are you ready to be a mother?

18:55.050 --> 18:56.180
Here is what I think.

18:57.600 --> 18:58.640
Nanny, check.

18:59.230 --> 19:00.170
Money, check.

19:00.790 --> 19:01.510
Big house,

19:01.530 --> 19:01.990
check.

19:02.420 --> 19:03.960
No, I didn't mean money.

19:03.990 --> 19:04.890
I mean,

19:08.640 --> 19:09.680
what about Sänäm?

19:11.160 --> 19:12.690
You hit the nail on the head.

19:13.270 --> 19:14.230
About this,

19:14.920 --> 19:15.610
only

19:15.720 --> 19:16.410
you two

19:16.430 --> 19:17.220
and I know.

19:17.330 --> 19:19.220
Do not let anyone else know it.

19:20.000 --> 19:21.440
Sadiq and my mother-in-law

19:21.440 --> 19:23.170
still don't know I'm pregnant.

19:24.310 --> 19:25.610
If she finds out,

19:25.610 --> 19:27.460
she'll react.

19:28.940 --> 19:30.830
Did your mother-in-law
make things difficult for you?

19:30.830 --> 19:32.940
Who could make things
difficult for me?

19:32.940 --> 19:34.400
Let me tell you something.

19:34.500 --> 19:36.660
Last week, I got up at 8 a.m.,

19:36.850 --> 19:38.590
and she hinted that I was lazy

19:38.590 --> 19:39.590
and not diligent.

19:40.590 --> 19:41.660
Then, this week,

19:41.730 --> 19:42.860
I got up at 6 a.m.

19:42.890 --> 19:45.070
and bought breakfast for the whole family,

19:45.070 --> 19:46.180
and she still complained

19:46.180 --> 19:48.140
that food from outside isn't clean.

19:48.140 --> 19:49.570
She advised me to cook myself.

19:49.570 --> 19:50.790
How could she be so harsh?

19:50.790 --> 19:52.250
Guess what time I woke up today?

19:52.250 --> 19:52.850
What time?

19:53.610 --> 19:55.090
4 o'clock? That early?

19:55.810 --> 19:56.810
Before dawn,

19:56.810 --> 19:58.270
I got up for the whole family

19:58.270 --> 19:59.780
to make dough and bake naan.

19:59.780 --> 20:01.780
As expected, she had nothing to say.

20:02.220 --> 20:03.790
Isn't it just playing the role of
a good daughter-in-law?

20:03.790 --> 20:05.000
What's so hard about it?

20:05.000 --> 20:06.610
As long as I want to do it,

20:06.770 --> 20:08.300
there's nothing I can't do.

20:10.500 --> 20:12.460
I have a performance in a month.

20:12.680 --> 20:14.980
Once I put on that baggy costume,

20:15.180 --> 20:17.240
who will be able to tell I'm pregnant?

20:18.850 --> 20:20.650
Cheer up. Have some pistachios.

20:21.090 --> 20:22.350
I'll go clean up first.

20:29.400 --> 20:30.860
She has morning sickness.

20:32.270 --> 20:32.860
Get this.

20:33.220 --> 20:33.900
Come on.

20:34.620 --> 20:36.180
Watch your hair.

20:36.590 --> 20:37.050
Come on.

20:39.730 --> 20:40.770
Nothing came out.

20:45.020 --> 20:46.780
Why do I feel sick eating this?

20:46.800 --> 20:49.330
-Do you want something sour?
-I'll remove it.

21:02.330 --> 21:03.350
Congratulations.

21:03.350 --> 21:04.880
You're going to be a mother.

21:11.770 --> 21:12.940
Thank you guys.

21:20.310 --> 21:21.570
I'll be the godmother.

21:21.970 --> 21:23.500
We will both be godmothers.

21:26.450 --> 21:29.270
Accompanying Minawar
as she becomes a mother,

21:30.630 --> 21:32.160
I share her fears,

21:32.840 --> 21:33.580
scares,

21:34.520 --> 21:35.520
and nervousness.

21:36.880 --> 21:38.440
I can't imagine

21:38.990 --> 21:41.250
that in the process of becoming a mother,

21:41.500 --> 21:43.000
a woman's body

21:43.640 --> 21:45.620
can house a brand new life.

21:47.440 --> 21:48.370
At the same time,

21:49.420 --> 21:50.830
we are also excited,

21:51.400 --> 21:52.180
joyful,

21:53.160 --> 21:55.250
and looking forward to this new life.

21:56.010 --> 21:57.480
This is truly an adventure

21:57.920 --> 21:59.720
and a journey full of surprises.

22:05.460 --> 22:06.400
I brought some food.

22:06.400 --> 22:07.930
Have a few bites before you go.

22:07.930 --> 22:10.130
What delicious food did you make for me?

22:10.790 --> 22:11.350
Eat some.

22:11.570 --> 22:12.700
Thin-skinned buns.

22:12.920 --> 22:13.980
I made them myself.

22:14.450 --> 22:15.330
You made them?

22:16.500 --> 22:17.070
Try them.

22:21.030 --> 22:22.000
Good for you.

22:23.000 --> 22:23.800
I'll save some

22:23.880 --> 22:26.710
to give to your dad
and trick him into thinking I made them.

22:26.710 --> 22:28.850
I can just make some more for him.

22:29.460 --> 22:31.170
Look at your little tricks.

22:37.010 --> 22:37.600
Mom.

22:38.860 --> 22:41.060
I'm not planning to go back to Shanghai.

22:48.350 --> 22:49.550
You're grown-up now.

22:49.920 --> 22:51.330
Just bear the consequences

22:51.330 --> 22:52.880
of your choice.

22:57.140 --> 22:58.240
I think

22:59.070 --> 23:00.270
I should retire.

23:02.420 --> 23:03.680
When I first came here,

23:04.010 --> 23:07.660
this hospital didn't even have a decent
traditional Chinese medicine doctor.

23:07.660 --> 23:10.590
I built this department from scratch.

23:10.810 --> 23:13.550
Now, it has over a dozen

23:15.390 --> 23:18.310
local doctors.

23:19.220 --> 23:21.460
They can all stand on their own now.

23:21.850 --> 23:23.910
I think I can leave with peace of mind.

23:28.740 --> 23:30.070
Can you bear to leave it?

23:31.140 --> 23:32.900
I also have to consider

23:32.900 --> 23:34.940
how to spend the rest of my life.

23:39.100 --> 23:39.900
That's great.

23:40.440 --> 23:41.440
I'm happy for you.

23:45.500 --> 23:45.940
Mom.

23:47.180 --> 23:49.240
How did you feel

23:49.900 --> 23:51.630
when you were pregnant with me?

23:53.700 --> 23:54.510
What's wrong?

23:56.130 --> 23:58.050
When I was pregnant with you,

23:58.300 --> 24:01.160
it was the busiest time
setting up this department.

24:01.290 --> 24:03.460
I threw up every day
for the first three months.

24:03.460 --> 24:04.610
Really, every single day.

24:04.610 --> 24:06.610
I threw up like crazy.

24:07.850 --> 24:09.180
When it came to the sixth month,

24:09.180 --> 24:10.610
I remember it clearly,

24:10.940 --> 24:12.110
you

24:12.500 --> 24:14.460
finally made peace with me.

24:15.090 --> 24:16.940
I'm sorry, Mom.

24:17.650 --> 24:19.600
Coming to aid Xinjiang while pregnant

24:19.600 --> 24:21.000
gave me a lot of pressure.

24:22.050 --> 24:25.240
At that time, all your grandparents

24:26.010 --> 24:26.940
were against it.

24:28.110 --> 24:29.240
I was thinking

24:29.240 --> 24:31.300
maybe I'd stay for three or four years

24:31.820 --> 24:33.260
to set up this department

24:33.610 --> 24:35.810
and go back once it was on track.

24:39.270 --> 24:40.530
But once I stayed here,

24:42.330 --> 24:43.990
I fell in love with this place.

24:44.330 --> 24:45.730
I couldn't bear to leave.

24:48.000 --> 24:51.200
Besides, seeing you so happy here,

24:52.090 --> 24:52.900
so free,

24:52.900 --> 24:54.110
and so carefree

24:55.010 --> 24:57.610
I strengthened my determination
to stay here.

24:59.770 --> 25:01.030
I should thank you.

25:02.680 --> 25:03.640
Because of you,

25:04.240 --> 25:05.500
I became who I am today.

25:05.880 --> 25:08.160
I should thank you even more.

25:10.810 --> 25:12.140
Let's thank each other.

25:32.250 --> 25:33.700
Is this your cat?

25:34.200 --> 25:34.660
Yes.

25:37.050 --> 25:39.180
How have you been lately?

25:39.180 --> 25:41.090
How could I be?

25:41.480 --> 25:42.420
Pretty good.

25:45.750 --> 25:46.830
Come on, kids.

25:46.960 --> 25:47.790
Eat some apricots.

25:47.790 --> 25:49.660
I just picked them from the orchard.

25:49.660 --> 25:51.260
I was just craving apricots.

25:51.460 --> 25:53.330
Ah, our cat

25:53.330 --> 25:55.020
is usually afraid of strangers.

25:55.020 --> 25:55.700
Come here.

25:56.480 --> 25:57.080
Come here.

25:57.700 --> 25:58.790
This is my grandpa.

26:00.000 --> 26:00.810
Hello, grandpa.

26:00.810 --> 26:02.020
Hello, child.

26:02.250 --> 26:03.640
Laili, my friend.

26:05.750 --> 26:06.290
Okay.

26:06.610 --> 26:07.220
Let's go.

26:07.220 --> 26:08.030
Go home.

26:08.230 --> 26:09.050
Be a good boy.

26:10.520 --> 26:11.980
This is what I want to mail.

26:11.980 --> 26:14.150
I was going to charge you five yuan,

26:14.180 --> 26:15.960
but I won't charge your family anymore

26:15.960 --> 26:17.090
since you helped me.

26:18.510 --> 26:19.240
Thanks.

26:21.010 --> 26:23.500
By the way, there's something

26:23.500 --> 26:24.760
I came here to tell you.

26:26.440 --> 26:27.370
You don't need to

26:27.380 --> 26:29.380
pretend to be my boyfriend anymore.

26:30.770 --> 26:32.570
Sorry for the trouble last time.

26:41.660 --> 26:42.450
Parhat.

26:44.810 --> 26:45.960
I was just thinking,

26:47.040 --> 26:49.660
if your dad knows you
don't have a boyfriend,

26:50.220 --> 26:52.670
wouldn't he still force you
to marry Mulading?

26:52.670 --> 26:54.900
Then, all the things we did before...

26:57.460 --> 26:58.250
Then...

26:59.420 --> 27:01.000
Then, how about

27:03.660 --> 27:05.850
I trouble you for a bit longer?

27:07.440 --> 27:08.180
It's okay.

27:08.180 --> 27:09.140
What did you...

27:14.480 --> 27:15.270
Have one.

27:54.630 --> 27:56.760
♪ Miss. My lady ♪

27:56.790 --> 27:58.650
♪ Follow me ♪

27:58.960 --> 28:01.160
♪ Play the fiddle and dance ♪

28:01.190 --> 28:03.190
♪ I'll send you home ♪

28:03.210 --> 28:05.690
♪ Since I met you that day ♪

28:05.720 --> 28:07.510
♪ You are always in my mind ♪

28:07.870 --> 28:10.220
♪ Don't throw away ♪

28:10.250 --> 28:12.150
♪ The roses I gave you in a hurry ♪

28:12.310 --> 28:14.220
♪ The roses I gave you ♪

28:14.530 --> 28:16.680
♪ The roses I gave you ♪

28:17.290 --> 28:33.780
♪ Come on, darling ♪

28:30.940 --> 28:33.920
Three, two, one.

28:36.920 --> 28:38.920
Alright, take a look. How is it?

28:38.920 --> 28:40.220
It looks so beautiful.

28:40.400 --> 28:42.000
It's because you are pretty.

28:44.510 --> 28:45.790
These figs'

28:46.830 --> 28:48.130
cultivation

28:48.160 --> 28:49.750
depends on the saplings.

28:50.400 --> 28:51.640
The older the sapling,

28:51.640 --> 28:53.110
the tastier the figs.

28:53.370 --> 28:54.440
The small ones'

28:54.590 --> 28:55.740
figs aren't sweet.

28:56.090 --> 28:57.160
That young man

28:57.160 --> 28:58.050
knows nothing.

28:58.050 --> 28:59.420
Figs from small saplings

28:59.420 --> 29:00.220
aren't sweet.

29:01.830 --> 29:03.230
I think it's quite sweet.

29:03.850 --> 29:05.510
You're making insinuations.

29:06.790 --> 29:07.720
In recent years,

29:07.920 --> 29:08.920
businessmen

29:08.920 --> 29:10.550
came to Kashgar's old town and left

29:10.550 --> 29:12.640
as they pleased.

29:12.640 --> 29:14.640
A few of them have actually stayed.

29:15.330 --> 29:16.330
Just like the figs

29:16.360 --> 29:17.550
growing on this tree, which fell,

29:17.550 --> 29:20.000
those men left without any hesitation.

29:20.000 --> 29:20.940
Am I right?

29:34.830 --> 29:35.640
Xia Zi.

29:36.440 --> 29:37.040
Look at me.

30:26.350 --> 30:27.130
Smash it.

30:32.650 --> 30:33.830
Smash it into pieces.

30:33.830 --> 30:34.440
Is this edible?

30:34.440 --> 30:36.030
It is. Eat it.

30:39.850 --> 30:40.810
I think Uncle

30:40.810 --> 30:42.140
won't agree so easily.

30:42.170 --> 30:43.430
Don't be so impatient.

30:45.070 --> 30:46.240
I'm not impatient.

30:46.530 --> 30:48.730
I really want to run this homestay well.

30:49.070 --> 30:51.030
I'm doing business on my own.

30:51.220 --> 30:52.880
No one shares the risk with me.

30:54.380 --> 30:55.180
Don't worry.

30:55.930 --> 30:58.330
I will protect this century-old shop well.

30:58.590 --> 30:59.530
It's a win-win situation.

30:59.530 --> 31:00.330
No one loses.

31:01.500 --> 31:03.700
Just like this fig,

31:05.240 --> 31:06.570
we hit it off instantly.

31:08.680 --> 31:10.210
That's not how you smash it.

31:14.030 --> 31:14.940
I will

31:15.460 --> 31:17.510
try to convince my uncle.

31:17.740 --> 31:19.400
But I have one condition.

31:19.790 --> 31:20.570
Within five years,

31:20.570 --> 31:22.070
this homestay cannot be
transferred to anyone else.

31:22.070 --> 31:24.270
This must be written into the contract.

31:24.590 --> 31:26.420
Alright, I agree.

31:26.900 --> 31:28.810
Then I think our new homestay

31:29.240 --> 31:31.010
can keep the carved wooden doors,

31:31.010 --> 31:33.460
and make it a folk culture photo spot.

31:34.080 --> 31:36.120
Yeah, that's a good idea.

31:36.550 --> 31:38.680
Let me think about how to tell my uncle.

31:47.560 --> 31:49.320
Come down quickly.

31:53.420 --> 31:54.450
Be careful.

31:58.960 --> 32:00.000
Uncle.

32:00.140 --> 32:00.880
Tell me.

32:01.420 --> 32:02.330
At this moment,

32:02.330 --> 32:03.960
if someone suddenly jumped out

32:03.960 --> 32:05.220
to play Tobok with you,

32:05.220 --> 32:06.220
what would you do?

32:07.880 --> 32:08.940
It's been a long time

32:08.940 --> 32:10.920
since I played this Tobok game.

32:11.180 --> 32:12.220
Besides,

32:12.450 --> 32:14.000
the person who played Tobok with me

32:14.000 --> 32:15.440
is no longer here.

32:15.810 --> 32:16.570
No one knows

32:16.570 --> 32:19.480
that my knucklebone is
in my pocket right now.

32:19.980 --> 32:20.980
But I know that

32:21.330 --> 32:21.830
I,

32:22.510 --> 32:23.720
Xia Hui's daughter,

32:23.720 --> 32:24.400
Xia Zi,

32:24.640 --> 32:26.200
the homestay's goddaughter,

32:26.200 --> 32:29.240
will officially take over
for my dad, Xia Hui,

32:29.330 --> 32:31.090
to play the game of Tobok with you.

32:31.090 --> 32:33.020
Please take out your knucklebone.

32:37.510 --> 32:38.510
My clothes are...

32:46.460 --> 32:48.080
I

32:48.530 --> 32:50.050
have been led astray

32:50.050 --> 32:51.270
by you little kids.

32:51.390 --> 32:53.120
You guys are really something.

33:04.400 --> 33:05.290
Open your hand

33:05.750 --> 33:07.550
and let me see your knucklebone.

33:08.070 --> 33:09.870
If I open my hand,

33:10.270 --> 33:12.090
and you do not have yours,

33:12.090 --> 33:13.440
you will lose to me.

33:17.110 --> 33:18.030
Uncle,

33:18.030 --> 33:19.380
if you lose,

33:19.740 --> 33:20.740
I don't want sheep

33:20.830 --> 33:21.720
or money.

33:22.010 --> 33:23.330
I want you to give me a chance.

33:23.330 --> 33:24.860
Give our homestay a chance.

33:39.980 --> 33:43.330
I know you are experienced at Tobok.

33:43.330 --> 33:45.010
If I let you lose to me so easily,

33:45.010 --> 33:45.940
it would be unfair to you.

33:45.940 --> 33:46.550
Let's do it another day.

33:46.550 --> 33:47.380
Arzugul.

34:07.940 --> 34:08.840
Uncle.

34:09.469 --> 34:10.800
I can't take it anymore.

34:11.190 --> 34:12.170
I need water.

34:12.460 --> 34:13.320
Water.

34:13.900 --> 34:14.920
You've only been buried for a short while.

34:14.920 --> 34:16.260
Can't you take it?

34:19.770 --> 34:20.500
Uncle.

34:21.050 --> 34:22.400
What are you holding?

34:22.710 --> 34:25.389
This is the Tobok game we play.

34:25.420 --> 34:26.820
See this knucklebone?

34:27.760 --> 34:29.090
Arzugul's dad has one,

34:29.480 --> 34:30.320
and I have one.

34:30.320 --> 34:32.030
If I go to him and ask,

34:32.130 --> 34:33.170
"Where is your knucklebone?"

34:33.170 --> 34:34.480
and he can't take it out,

34:34.480 --> 34:36.380
he has to compensate me with a sheep.

34:36.380 --> 34:38.010
If he asks me for them,

34:38.010 --> 34:38.860
and I can't take one out,

34:38.860 --> 34:40.550
I have to give him a sheep.

34:40.860 --> 34:41.880
But nowadays,

34:41.880 --> 34:43.190
these young guys

34:43.190 --> 34:44.170
don't

34:44.210 --> 34:45.540
play this game anymore.

34:48.110 --> 34:49.030
Alright.

34:49.290 --> 34:50.590
I see you can't take it anymore.

34:50.590 --> 34:52.190
After a few more sand therapies,

34:52.190 --> 34:53.860
all your illnesses will be gone.

34:53.860 --> 34:54.730
Come on.

34:54.730 --> 34:55.830
Let's go.

34:58.550 --> 35:00.000
Uncle, what's up?

35:00.030 --> 35:01.480
Slowly.

35:01.510 --> 35:02.420
Let's hurry back.

35:02.420 --> 35:03.920
Come on, take it easy.

35:04.300 --> 35:05.320
It burns.

35:16.990 --> 35:18.240
Uncle, slow down.

35:21.210 --> 35:21.820
I'm fine.

35:23.070 --> 35:24.920
-What did the doctor say?
-So serious?

35:24.920 --> 35:26.450
Why are you in a wheelchair?

35:26.460 --> 35:27.520
The bones are fine.

35:27.590 --> 35:28.920
Just a slight sprain.

35:30.120 --> 35:30.850
Come on, son.

35:31.340 --> 35:33.140
Look how dirty your clothes are.

35:33.150 --> 35:33.910
Let me wash them for you.

35:33.910 --> 35:34.630
Uncle.

35:35.030 --> 35:37.440
Since the bones are fine,

35:38.530 --> 35:40.460
please take out your knucklebone.

35:42.800 --> 35:43.840
Naughty girl.

35:44.330 --> 35:46.000
I'm already in a wheelchair.

35:46.110 --> 35:49.240
Are you still trying
to take advantage of my misfortune?

35:49.260 --> 35:50.590
When you played this game with my Dad,

35:50.590 --> 35:52.760
didn't you always take advantage of him?

35:52.760 --> 35:54.240
I remember one year, there was a flood,

35:54.240 --> 35:56.130
and my mom and I hid in a tree.

35:56.190 --> 35:58.320
You waded across the river to tell him,

35:58.780 --> 36:00.400
"Take out your knucklebone".

36:00.400 --> 36:01.000
Forgot it?

36:01.110 --> 36:02.530
That's how the game is played.

36:02.530 --> 36:03.190
Right.

36:03.190 --> 36:05.320
That's exactly how the game is played.

36:07.980 --> 36:10.850
You knew I changed
clothes in the hospital.

36:11.760 --> 36:12.320
Here.

36:19.980 --> 36:20.810
Zhou.

36:30.150 --> 36:31.450
I'm helping you.

36:31.480 --> 36:32.610
Uncle gave it to me.

36:33.360 --> 36:34.480
You cheated.

36:34.480 --> 36:36.300
I was prepared for this.

36:36.300 --> 36:38.720
Before I went into the hospital,

36:38.840 --> 36:40.570
I gave the knucklebone to Zhou.

36:40.570 --> 36:41.150
Girl.

36:42.360 --> 36:43.760
Now that your Dad is gone,

36:45.260 --> 36:46.810
the game we played

36:46.830 --> 36:48.290
should also come to an end.

36:48.420 --> 36:49.460
I know why

36:49.460 --> 36:51.460
you wanted to play this game with me.

36:51.460 --> 36:52.320
Opportunities

36:52.840 --> 36:55.040
can't be obtained by winning or losing.

36:55.100 --> 36:56.250
Time shows

36:56.550 --> 36:58.260
a person's true colors.

36:58.840 --> 37:00.480
It can just be won by sincerity.

37:00.480 --> 37:01.540
Do you understand?

37:04.220 --> 37:05.040
Do you two

37:05.070 --> 37:06.870
dare to play Tobok one more time?

37:08.190 --> 37:09.530
The only condition is

37:10.010 --> 37:11.420
to keep our inn

37:11.980 --> 37:12.960
and make it

37:13.170 --> 37:15.690
prosperous again.

37:20.480 --> 37:22.810
To the beginning of our great friendship.

37:23.170 --> 37:25.500
To the beginning of our great friendship.

37:32.290 --> 37:33.690
Do you need an airport pickup?

37:33.690 --> 37:35.690
Okay, please send me the flight number.

37:35.690 --> 37:36.500
I'll arrange it later.

37:35.860 --> 37:36.430
[Lobby manager]

37:37.220 --> 37:38.100
[Already placed an order]

37:47.840 --> 37:48.840
Look, our family

37:48.840 --> 37:50.420
also has a space like this.

37:50.420 --> 37:51.760
We can dance like this

37:51.760 --> 37:52.730
in that space too.

37:52.730 --> 37:53.280
Right.

37:59.340 --> 37:59.900
This shop is the one I mentioned before.

37:59.900 --> 38:01.820
A room costs 1,500 yuan a night.

38:02.000 --> 38:03.730
There are not many rooms,

38:03.760 --> 38:06.020
but they are almost always fully booked.

38:06.030 --> 38:08.030
Just like ours, it has three floors.

38:11.540 --> 38:13.800
Uncle, look how booming the business is.

38:14.260 --> 38:15.320
Just a little bit of food

38:15.320 --> 38:16.390
costs 89 yuan?

38:16.420 --> 38:17.300
Uncle.

38:17.500 --> 38:18.700
Keep your voice down.

38:18.820 --> 38:20.140
People are mainly paying
for the atmosphere

38:20.140 --> 38:21.340
and the environment.

38:21.630 --> 38:22.500
These few shops

38:22.500 --> 38:25.050
are hard to book during the peak season.

38:25.050 --> 38:27.040
Prices are probably

38:27.090 --> 38:29.090
several or even over ten times ours.

38:29.230 --> 38:30.090
That's normal.

38:30.320 --> 38:31.250
Over ten times?

38:31.280 --> 38:31.760
Yes.

38:31.780 --> 38:32.610
So expensive.

38:32.650 --> 38:33.530
Exactly.

38:33.850 --> 38:34.410
Uncle.

38:34.840 --> 38:36.760
I think if we

38:36.760 --> 38:37.780
renovate our shop too,

38:37.780 --> 38:39.580
it could be this popular as well.

38:39.710 --> 38:42.480
We are living in the new Kashgar now.

38:42.900 --> 38:45.630
That means having both heritage
and innovation.

38:46.770 --> 38:48.870
I'll redesign and renovate

38:48.900 --> 38:50.050
our home.

39:02.110 --> 39:04.170
You don't plan to return to Shanghai?

39:06.360 --> 39:07.100
Yes.

39:07.530 --> 39:08.930
I plan to stay in Kashgar.

39:09.320 --> 39:10.340
No, Xia Zi.

39:11.190 --> 39:12.920
You have to go back to Shanghai.

39:14.290 --> 39:15.520
Maybe it's because

39:15.590 --> 39:17.920
I'm used to constantly chasing after you.

39:18.360 --> 39:20.000
You got into a school in Shanghai,

39:20.000 --> 39:21.670
and I joined the song and dance troupe.

39:21.670 --> 39:22.670
You bought a house,

39:22.670 --> 39:24.870
and I wanted to be the principal dancer.

39:26.010 --> 39:27.230
And now you're telling me

39:27.230 --> 39:28.570
you want to go back to Kashgar?

39:28.570 --> 39:29.660
Are you kidding me?

39:30.790 --> 39:32.250
What can you do here?

39:32.670 --> 39:34.710
Just be Manager Xia forever?

39:34.940 --> 39:36.000
That's a good idea.

39:38.030 --> 39:39.380
Right now,

39:39.850 --> 39:42.180
I think I'm starting to like this feeling.

39:43.240 --> 39:44.240
The grain

39:44.480 --> 39:45.540
and the weeds

39:45.650 --> 39:46.940
grew together.

39:49.780 --> 39:51.470
Grain and weeds?

39:52.280 --> 39:52.880
All right.

40:19.930 --> 40:20.980
Minawar,

40:21.690 --> 40:23.690
you did a good job keeping it secret.

40:23.970 --> 40:26.130
If your mother-in-law hadn't
come to ask for a leave for you today,

40:26.130 --> 40:27.250
how long

40:27.590 --> 40:29.590
were you planning to hide it from us?

40:30.960 --> 40:31.860
I...

40:32.190 --> 40:33.280
Having a baby is a good thing.

40:33.280 --> 40:34.540
What are you afraid of?

40:36.260 --> 40:38.480
I wanted to tell you
after the performance.

40:38.480 --> 40:39.410
That won't work.

40:39.660 --> 40:41.480
Your mother-in-law specially
came to tell us.

40:41.480 --> 40:42.680
We can't be careless.

40:42.850 --> 40:43.550
How about this?

40:43.550 --> 40:44.570
From tomorrow onwards,

40:44.570 --> 40:45.830
work in the dressing room.

40:45.830 --> 40:47.060
The work there is lighter,

40:47.060 --> 40:48.660
which is good for both you and the baby.

40:48.660 --> 40:51.720
Let Gulistan be the leading actress
for the time being.

40:54.330 --> 40:56.270
How did they know you were pregnant?

40:56.270 --> 40:57.750
That's so disrespectful.

40:59.130 --> 40:59.610
Then,

41:00.750 --> 41:01.770
what about

41:02.280 --> 41:03.050
Sänäm?

41:04.150 --> 41:05.810
Gulistan is playing the role.

41:07.320 --> 41:08.320
Why?

41:09.610 --> 41:11.610
They don't know that lately,

41:13.030 --> 41:14.650
I practiced Sänäm

41:16.370 --> 41:18.100
until my feet cramped.

41:19.670 --> 41:22.510
Every day, I longed to be Sänäm on stage.

41:28.300 --> 41:29.570
I am Sänäm.

41:30.980 --> 41:31.940
I have already

41:31.960 --> 41:33.440
embodied Sänäm.

41:35.210 --> 41:37.010
No one is more like Sänäm than me.

41:44.690 --> 41:46.460
Do you want to see me dance?

41:50.880 --> 41:51.530
Yes.
